        "Rendered by its bar (geometry, state and motion) or, outside a bar, as a single destination with its own active state; activation emits mdTabClick { index } and follows href / target through the host URL router unless prevented.",
        "The 56 × 32 indicator pill (scaleX 200 ms emphasized-decelerate, opacity 100 ms), the icon (activeIcon and the active-icon / icon slots), the label (600 active / 500 inactive, hidden but named in selected mode, absent in icon-only mode), dot and capped large badges (badgeMax), hard and soft disabled, density 0 to -4.",
